@dougen/dsh-deepseek-usage README · Installation and usage：**Step 3 — restart `dsh web`** and open the URL it prints. The card sits at the bottom of the sidebar, below the Cordis panel button; click it to refresh right away. Provider mappings and subscription tokens are configured in **Settings → DeepSeek Usage**; when the route behind the selected model is not supported, the card offers a **Set up mapping** button that opens that page directly.

